# Syntax

Syntax highlighting with **TextMate** grammars and _VS Code_ themes. See [the docs](https://example.com "Docs").

- Pure Dart core
- `inline code` and ~~strike~~
  1. Nested ordered item

> Quote with `code`.

```dart
void main() {
  print('Hello, ${'world'}!');
}
```

```yaml
name: demo
version: 1.0.0
```

```json
{"key": [1, 2.5, true, null]}
```

```shellscript
dart pub add syntax --path ../syntax
```

| Column | Value |
| ------ | ----: |
| a      |     1 |

